se they were the  best people for the job  we always appoint for people who are  best person for the job driving the  government's agenda in terms of change  and reform whether that's in  universities whether that's in schools  whether that's in any other sector of  society because actually we want to  deliver change we want to deliver the  leveling up agenda  that's always the focus and our focus is  getting the best people  into those jobs to deliver that change  and help us deliver the agenda  that we were elected to deliver back in  2019

